Dear Mark,

Thanks for your response. I apologize for the remedial questions -- I'd asked them though because I've taken classes with a large focus on occupancy modelling, but it seems that a few things about the way unmarkedMultFrame is set up are contrary to what I've learned and read about setting up occupancy models.

